      <title>希音港交所上市后，增长标尺转向供给端技术服务能力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/%E5%B8%8C%E9%9F%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%BA%A4%E6%89%80%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82%E5%90%8E%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF%E6%A0%87%E5%B0%BA%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91%E4%BE%9B%E7%BB%99%E7%AB%AF%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B/</link>
